nchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"  黑方还有炮6平5及车8进4的选择，另成体系。","text":"  黑方还有炮6平5及车8进4的选择，另成体系。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"  至此可以看出，黑方的构思是冲卒、进炮构成河口防线，但被红方一番旁敲侧击之后，即陷入被动。||  数十年后，胡荣华冲3卒后，则续以马3进4伺机兑马，然后根据红方的动向或开放3路线或补架列炮的全新构思，给反宫马方注入了新鲜血液。","text":"  至此可以看出，黑方的构思是冲卒、进炮构成河口防线，但被红方一番旁敲侧击之后，即陷入被动。\n  数十年后，胡荣华冲3卒后，则续以马3进4伺机兑马，然后根据红方的动向或开放3路线或补架列炮的全新构思，给反宫马方注入了新鲜血液。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"  黑马实在忍受不了红方的高压而跳出。","text":"  黑马实在忍受不了红方的高压而跳出。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"  至此，黑方左翼马炮呆滞、右翼子力受牵，布局已大为亏损。","text":"  至此，黑方左翼马炮呆滞、右翼子力受牵，布局已大为亏损。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"  补士稳健，也可直接炮五进四吃卒。","text":"  补士稳健，也可直接炮五进四吃卒。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"  弃兵攻法犀利！联系以后的一系列战术组合，极具观赏性。当然，红方如改走炮五进四也是稳占优势。","text":"  弃兵攻法犀利！联系以后的一系列战术组合，极具观赏性。当然，红方如改走炮五进四也是稳占优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"  弃车精彩！是弃兵跃马后的核心手段。","text":"  弃车精彩！是弃兵跃马后的核心手段。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"  不吃车也是输定，索性任君施妙手吧！","text":"  不吃车也是输定，索性任君施妙手吧！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"  自弃兵后红方的攻法精妙绝伦，令人赏心悦目！唯此着白璧微瑕，应改走炮六进一，前车进３，车四平六，士５进４，车六进一，将４平５，车六进一，将５退１，车六平四，将５平４，车四进一，将４进１，马七退六。一气呵成精妙杀局！","text":"  自弃兵后红方的攻法精妙绝伦，令人赏心悦目！唯此着白璧微瑕，应改走炮六进一，前车进３，车四平六，士５进４，车六进一，将４平５，车六进一，将５退１，车六平四，将５平４，车四进一，将４进１，马七退六。一气呵成精妙杀局！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"  由于红方优势过大，故最终仍为红胜，不再赘述。","text":"  由于红方优势过大，故最终仍为红胜，不再赘述。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment59:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment59","raw_text":"红胜","text":"红胜","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":59,"anchor_node_id":"0:59","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_55:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_55","raw_text":"红胜。","text":"红胜。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":55,"anchor_node_id":"1:55","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["张德魁 先胜 万启有"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["B34 中炮右横车对反宫马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_author":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":21,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":2,"structured_branches":1,"line_statuses":{"legal":2},"source_move_records":72,"legal_move_records":72,"annotations":13,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":13}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl